<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Hello, roget.</p>
<p>First, thanks for commenting. and pardon for my odd syntax.</p>
<p>Second, this is the result of experimenting about writing in a very tight time for me. And this suffers because of it.</p>
<p>Third, I agree that the description is thin. And the reason of that it's a combination of trying to make it subtle<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-176481-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-176481-1')">1</a></sup> and because I don't write in English, I have to think how to write it, translate, correcting odd syntax and asking someone to see the draft.</p>
<p>Fourth, the novel descriptions all share a common theme and that is the omission of a certain word. Also, the Lady is symbolic.</p>
<p>Fifth, I could have put a crosslink, but I wanted to let the readers figure it themselves. About the scientist, for us it behaves badly, in Foundationverse it behaves badly too but for different reasons and in his mind he has the purest intentions.</p>
<p>After jamcon maybe I will change some things.</p>
